  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 306056b5c49b6488c91ec00ee567277f, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialGnome
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogue:
  - Psst! Down Here! I'm Guido, the Tutorial Gnome!
  - I'm just here to give you a little Tutorial Gnome welcome here in Clearwater!
  - As you've alrerady seen, pressing 'F' will let you talk to people!
  - The 'WASD' keys will let you walk around, and you can look at your surroudnings
    by moving your mouse. And you can click the left mouse button to interact with
    some objects and puzzles!
  - I'd do the rest of my 4 hour long welcome speech, but I'm not in the mood since
    the lake is all dirty and full of nasty rotton creatures.
  - If only someone would go solve all the puzzles to save the lake! Maybe they'd
    start by talking to the people around these cabins...
  - Anyway toodeloo! Have fun or something.
